<BaseLayout title="Privacy Policy" description="BrewTested privacy policy. How we handle data, cookies, and affiliate tracking.">
  <article class="prose prose-amber max-w-none">
    <h1>Privacy Policy</h1>
    <p><em>Last updated: May 2026</em></p>

    <h2>Who We Are</h2>
    <p>BrewTested (brewtested.com) is an independent review site covering coffee makers, grinders, espresso machines, and kitchen gear. Contact: <a href="mailto:paulet4a5@gmail.com">paulet4a5@gmail.com</a></p>

    <h2>What Data We Collect</h2>
    <p>We do not collect personal data directly. We do not have user accounts, comment systems, or contact forms that store information.</p>

    <h3>Automatically Collected Data</h3>
    <p>When you visit BrewTested, standard web server logs may record your IP address, browser type, referring URL, and pages visited. This data is used only for aggregate traffic analysis and is not sold or shared with third parties.</p>

    <h2>Affiliate Links and Third-Party Tracking</h2>
    <p>BrewTested participates in the Amazon Associates program and other affiliate programs. When you click an affiliate link:</p>
    <ul>
      <li>Amazon and other retailers may set cookies on your browser to track purchases for commission attribution.</li>
      <li>These cookies are governed by the respective retailer's privacy policy, not ours.</li>
      <li>We earn a small commission if you make a purchase — at no extra cost to you.</li>
    </ul>

    <h2>Cookies</h2>
    <p>BrewTested itself does not set first-party cookies. Third-party services (Amazon Associates, any analytics) may set their own cookies per their policies.</p>

    <h2>Google Search Console</h2>
    <p>We use Google Search Console to monitor site indexing. This service does not collect personally identifiable information about site visitors.</p>

    <h2>External Links</h2>
    <p>Our articles link to Amazon and other retailers. Once you leave BrewTested, their privacy policies apply. We are not responsible for third-party practices.</p>

    <h2>Children's Privacy</h2>
    <p>BrewTested is not directed at children under 13. We do not knowingly collect information from minors.</p>

    <h2>Changes to This Policy</h2>
    <p>We may update this policy occasionally. Changes will be reflected by the "Last updated" date above. Continued use of the site after changes constitutes acceptance.</p>

    <h2>Contact</h2>
    <p>Questions about this policy? Email <a href="mailto:paulet4a5@gmail.com">paulet4a5@gmail.com</a>.</p>
  </article>
</BaseLayout>
